      "source": "docs/chapters/09-05-lesson.md:13",
      "judgment": "adaptor接手iterator/callback不主動clone、lazy map的FnMut契約和visits借用時點正確。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-05-lesson.md:40",
      "judgment": "filter借&Item而交回原Item，slice路徑&&i32→&i32與ownedString路徑&String→String清楚；map下一步只需單層*。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-05-lesson.md:62",
      "judgment": "FromIterator<A>與IntoIterator輸入、collect由目標指定、Vec沒有自動&i32→i32正確；Vec Debug/PartialEq與method turbofish/型別路徑在首次完整使用前說明。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-05-lesson.md:109",
      "judgment": "fold的初值/Item/accumulator/空來源、FnMut雙參數先教；necessary local clippy::unnecessary_fold allow在首snippet前:113先說明，答案:163回用。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-05-lesson.md:131",
      "judgment": "Result collect遇第一Err停止pull、不交回部分Vec、空來源Ok(empty)、不套用From換錯誤型別；實際visits=2和原來源借用均一致。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-06-lesson.md:15",
      "judgment": "chars是Unicode scalar，e+U+0301為2scalars/3bytes；char Debug與Unicode escape先解釋。lines處理LF/CRLF、尾行、連續空行、空字串與單獨CR準確，沒有偷用trim。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-06-lesson.md:40",
      "judgment": "is_empty byte長度判斷、filter&&str、RPIT/elision與2024capture回指到已讀9.3/7.1，工作仍依來源。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-06-lesson.md:50",
      "judgment": "Entry接手候選key並借map；and_modify/or_insert/or_insert_with接收/回傳及FnOnce契約在使用前。明說重複鍵仍先to_owned，沒有不實零複製承諾。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-06-lesson.md:108",
      "judgment": "HashMap iter/iter_mut/into_iter的tuple各欄位ownership正確；mutable iterator不允許改key，且順序任意。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-07-lesson.md:15",
      "judgment": "Ordering/PartialOrd/Ord、Option<Ordering>、NaN與f64::NAN associated constant先教。str/String字典bytes順序與報表材料一致。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-07-lesson.md:33",
      "judgment": "sort/sort_by_key/sort_by mutable unit與stable契約、FnMut和key:Ord準確；sort_unstable不配置heap暫存及不保等值原序的界線準確。as_mut_slice已由5.4/9.4教。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/09-07-lesson.md:75",
      "judgment": "right.count cmp left.count使多次數左筆回Less而先出現；平手名稱升序。僅stable不能修任意HashMap來源順序，完整tie-break才固定結果。String由map移入Vec而非clone，答案反轉次數方向正確。"
    }
